      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently highlight the kindness and empathy shown by the veterinary team, noting that doctors take time to listen to individual concerns. Reviewers mention that staff remain calm and patient with anxious pets and clearly explain aftercare. A couple of clients raised questions regarding communication and quoted fees, but the vast majority praise the team's attentiveness."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thoughtful handling for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the clinic's gentle approach toward nervous dogs and young kittens during consultations and surgical procedures. Reviewers note that veterinary staff use treats and calm methods to put pets at ease. Owners of reactive dogs specifically praise the practice for providing dedicated quiet waiting areas away from other animals."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive messaging and triage advice"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients warmly praise the practice for quick communication and helpful advice via WhatsApp, noting that messaging resolves queries smoothly. Remote triage consultations and thoughtful follow-up calls are also widely appreciated. However, a couple of pet parents noted delays and confusion regarding test results and post-surgery care, leaving feedback mixed."
      }
    }
  ],
